🚀 RAG Q&A Chatbot – Loan Approval Assistant

This project is a chatbot that answers questions related to loan approvals using RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation). It searches through loan data and uses Gemini AI to give accurate responses.

# Features:

✨Uses FAISS for document search
✨Gemini API for generating answers
✨Built with Streamlit
✨Based on a loan approval dataset

# How to Run:

✨Install dependencies: pip install -r requirements.txt
✨Build index: python retriever/build_vector_store.py
✨Run the app: streamlit run app/streamlit_app.py

# Live App:
👉 https://chatbot-project-muskan2003.streamlit.app/

🚀 Built during Week 8 of Celebal Technologies Internship

